            "answer": {
              "short": "$12$",
              "worked": "For Betty and Belinda together, treat them as one unit. Arrange the 4 units around the table, allowing $2!$ internal arrangements of the pair.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Together}&=(4-1)!\\times2!\\\\&=12\\end{aligned}$$\nSubtract these from all arrangements:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Apart}&=24-12\\\\&=12\\end{aligned}$$",
