          "worked": "Treat Betty and Bob as a single unit, with $2!$ internal arrangements. Fix this unit's position around the table. Brad must occupy the middle of the three remaining positions so that Ben and Belinda sit apart. Ben and Belinda can occupy the other two positions in 2 ways.\n$$2\\times2!=4$$",
